      'Thanks for sharing!',
      'I love that! 🔥',
      'Awesome! Keep it up!',
      'Check your DMs!',
      'Let\'s connect!',
    ];
    return replies[DateTime.now().millisecondsSinceEpoch % replies.length];
  }

  String _getSenderName(String userId) {
